#: ../../../boards/nordicnrf51/seeedTinyBLE.rst:22
msgid ""
"Platform :ref:`platform_nordicnrf51`: The Nordic nRF51 Series is a family of "
"highly flexible, multi-protocol, system-on-chip (SoC) devices for ultra-low "
"power wireless applications. nRF51 Series devices support a range of "
"protocol stacks including Bluetooth Smart (previously called Bluetooth low "
"energy), ANT and proprietary 2.4GHz protocols such as Gazell."
